 {name:"Open, somehow",time:"11:47 PM",roster:[0,1,2,5],routine:"stock",routineLabel:"Unpack the delivery, then fill a shelf",event:"star",eventLabel:"A star on the doormat",sky:"Most of the stars are where you left them.",note:"The supplier has left a crate. Milk goes in the fridge. The universe can wait.",close:"Four ordinary purchases. One very unordinary night. You leave the coffee warmer on."},
 {name:"The usual",time:"12:06 AM",roster:[1,4,3,0],routine:"coffee",routineLabel:"Brew a fresh pot of coffee",event:"radio",eventLabel:"A station between stations",sky:"The Teapot constellation has misplaced its handle.",note:"Someone has straightened the welcome mat. Nobody admits to it.",close:"The radio has a new favourite song. Your regulars have begun saying 'see you tomorrow'."},
 {name:"Yesterday, tomorrow",time:"12:32 AM",roster:[3,2,5,4],routine:"clean",routineLabel:"Wipe the little spill by the fridge",event:"clock",eventLabel:"The clock loses a minute",sky:"The sky is turning the colour of an old bruise. A beautiful one.",note:"The delivery note is dated tomorrow. The noodles expire yesterday. Neither seems concerned.",close:"One minute refuses to end. Eventually, you tell it the shop will be here tomorrow."},
 {name:"Cash only, mostly",time:"12:58 AM",roster:[2,0,1,3],routine:"noodles",routineLabel:"Prepare something warm",event:"name",eventLabel:"A name with nowhere to go",sky:"The petrol station across the road is gone. Its OPEN sign is still there.",note:"There are things in the till which cannot be counted. You make room anyway.",close:"The missing petrol station leaves a surprisingly polite gap. You sweep your side of the road."},
 {name:"Last supplier",time:"01:19 AM",roster:[4,5,0,2],routine:"stock",routineLabel:"Open the final delivery and stock a shelf",event:"delivery",eventLabel:"An invoice for tomorrow",sky:"The road ends a few metres beyond the door. The delivery still arrived.",note:"LAST DELIVERY, the label says. Underneath: THANKS FOR YOUR BUSINESS, ALL OF IT.",close:"You keep the box. It is a very good box. This feels like a defensible reason."},
 {name:"End-of-world specials",time:"01:43 AM",roster:[1,3,4,5],routine:"clean",routineLabel:"Mop up the rain that has forgotten how to fall",event:"table",eventLabel:"A table for whoever is left",sky:"Loose things have begun rising. Outside, even echoes have stopped returning.",note:"Put the kettle on. It is a surprisingly effective response to the circumstances.",close:"The chairs do not match. The cups do not match. Everyone fits."},
 {name:"One final night",time:"02:00 AM",roster:[0,1,2,3,4,5],routine:"coffee",routineLabel:"Make one last pot of coffee",event:"light",eventLabel:"The last light",sky:"Nothing outside is measuring time anymore. In here, the fridge is humming.",note:"Nobody is in a hurry. There is enough for everyone's usual.",close:"There is no shift after this one. There might be something else."}
];
