 impossible:{name:"an impossible coin",art:"impossible",action:"Turn it onto its third side",unseen:"Both faces say HEADS. The edge seems to be looking at you.",seen:"The third side says PLEASE ACCEPT. Counterfeiting this would be harder than earning it.",effect:"The receipt is a little longer on the inside. The banana is still a banana."},
