 seconds:{name:"twenty seconds of time",art:"seconds",action:"Compare it with the shop clock",unseen:"The little hourglass is pouring upwards.",seen:"Twenty honest seconds. They smell faintly of next Tuesday.",effect:"The sky holds its breath. The kettle finishes a little sooner."},
 favour:{name:"a handwritten favour",art:"favour",action:"Read the small print",unseen:"I OWE YOU ONE. Underlined twice.",seen:"'One lift, one repair, or help moving a surprisingly heavy universe. — Dave'",effect:"You pin the promise by the phone. Some kinds of credit actually mean something."},
 name:{name:"a forgotten name",art:"name",action:"Read it out loud",unseen:"A folded scrap of paper. The ink is trying not to disappear.",seen:"'Aster.' Nimbus whispers it back. The fridge light steadies when you say it.",effect:"ASTER appears on the guestbook. Something has a place in the world again."}
